  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In The Legends of Ren Zu, Perseverance thanks the miniman for giving it life after three lines about cold, loneliness, and fear that fail to stop the climb.",
        "chapters": [
          1276
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Flood Extremity first treats perseverance Gu as only a Gu from that book, but Black Extremity states that Perseverance Immortal Gu has existed, and that Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable refined it, entered the Door of Life and Death, brought Reverse Flow River into the world, and was the river’s first owner.",
        "chapters": [
          1277
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "genesis-lotus",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_flood_extremity",
          "char_sun_ming_lu",
          "char_genesis_lotus_immortal_venerable",
          "loc_door_of_life_and_death",
          "loc_reverse_flow_river"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s killer move Vajra Shell combines rank six Vajra Thought Immortal Gu as its core with rank seven Perseverance Immortal Gu, along with large numbers of mortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1310
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "vajra-shell-component",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "move_vajra_shell",
          "gu_vajra_thought_immortal_gu",
          "sys_mortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Preparing bountiful year to raise dragon scale sea area’s production, Fang Yuan adds rank seven Perseverance Immortal Gu into the killer move as its first supplementary Gu worm, alongside year Gu as the core. The addition doubles bountiful year’s duration, letting a single activation affect the immortal aperture for two years instead of one, but it also shrinks the killer move’s effective range and stretches its activation time toward half a month.",
        "chapters": [
          1313
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "bountiful-year-addition",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_year_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Besides myriad self Immortal Gu, Fang Yuan names another human path Immortal Gu he holds: perseverance Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          1774
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "human-path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_myriad_self_immortal_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
